project_license.md

# Operator-internal md reports — PERMANENT. ALL generated experiment/result/audit
# markdown (CLEANUP_RESULTS, *_RESULTS, REPO_AS_BUILT, etc.) lives here and is
# NEVER tracked. Do not remove this entry; do not commit anything under it. New
# experiment write-ups go in docs/dev/reports/, not the repo root.
docs/dev/reports/
